      47.99,
      470.56,
      542.52,
      532.03
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under paragraph 3 of Article 44 of the Constitution of Sri Lanka read with subsection (2) of Section 7 of the Bank of Ceylon Ordinance (Chapter 397), I, Anura Kumara Dissanayake, President of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, do by this Order determine that the paid-up capital of the Bank of Ceylon be increased from Rupees Twenty-Five Thousand Million (Rs. 25,000,000,000) to Rupees Twenty-Five Thousand and Seven Hundred and Thirty Million. (Rs. 25,730,000,000).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
